export const SECRET_TEXT="<p>We once experimented on a small spider. We wanted to understand how it spun such strong webs.</p><p>The experiment did not go as planned. Every night, it grew, until it became enormous. The glass shattered. The lights went out. When they came back on, the chamber was empty.</p><p>To whoever is reading this: be careful. The spider is dangerous. It can kill you. Do not stay in this house. Find the axe, break the boards, and get out.</p><p>If you hear scratching overhead, do not assume it is the wind. It learned to walk on the ceiling, too.</p><p>We hid the journal here, hoping the webs would never reach it.</p><p><em>The final line was written with a shaking hand: Do not go back to check whether it is still there.</em></p>";
